to know what it was,

954
01:27:44.983 --> 01:27:47.710
but I have got to stop
the bleeding in your leg.

955
01:27:47.814 --> 01:27:49.402
Okay, so let's go.
Let's go, Let's go.

956
01:27:49.505 --> 01:27:50.758
Get in the car,
and we'll go to the hospital.

957
01:27:50.782 --> 01:27:53.682
Please, please.
Look at me.

958
01:27:53.785 --> 01:27:55.580
