and we'll get to the hospital.

963
01:28:04.693 --> 01:28:07.834
But I got to do this first.

964
01:28:07.937 --> 01:28:09.905
You okay with that?

965
01:28:10.008 --> 01:28:12.839
Sweetie?

966
01:28:12.942 --> 01:28:15.013
Okay.

967
01:28:17.947 --> 01:28:19.742
Sorry.

